    "PROTOTYPE, NOT PROOF. Read the limits first:",
    "1. Prior built with hindsight: the base probabilities (model v1.4.0) were set in 2026 by someone who knew 2008, 2020 and 2022. This favours 'model' and 'prior-only'. Only model vs prior-only isolates the data-driven update.",
